Kind: ablation
Issue: #412
Accel: kvm
Takes out: the generation check in pmap_cr3_for() -- a slot found for the space keeps its entries whatever its generation says, so a space changed while a processor only cached it is read through the stale entries when the processor comes back; needs PCID, which TCG and victus lack: caught under KVM on OMEGA and omen, on omen's metal, and on GitHub's Xeon 8573C and EPYC 9V74, and not on the EPYC 7763 in 4 boots of 4 (runs 38370713633, 38381876377), where [1]'s control now says NOT ASKED if no entry outlives its round
Run: --entry 0 300 -smp 4
Expect: pcid_test: \[1\] .*its OLD frame.*WRONG \(#412\)

